node_modules/
*.tsbuildinfo
*.log
.DS_Store
artifacts/
# Scratch space: local-only by construction, so ignore the whole tree rather
# than a single leaf. The 2048px portrait masters live in
# .scratch/avatar-sources-2048/ — they are 87 MB and exist only to regenerate
# the shipped avatars, so they must never be committed.
.scratch/
# Local generation-time state: sync-paths.mjs rewrites it per run (a cert
# generation records the tag-suffixed checkout name). Never commit it.
.generated-harness
# `packages/*/lib` is deliberately tracked. A DSH install from a GitHub address
# clones this branch and packs the `files` allowlist without running any build,
# so the bundles have to live in the tree; a `prepare` script cannot replace
# them, because this build needs the adjacent Harness checkout. Keep them in
# step with `src/` — `npm run check:bundle` fails when a build moves one.
